# 统一文本文件行尾为 LF（仓库存储与检出均用 LF），
# 消除 Windows core.autocrlf=true 造成的 git status 全量噪音。
# 声明 binary 的例外文件必须放在本规则之后。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件：防止 text=auto 误判导致内容被转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.jar binary
*.war binary
*.class binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.pptx binary
